      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals for 12 studies in children: gastric aspirate with a microbiological reference standard. Sensitivity ranges from 0.00 to 1.00 where estimable and specificity from 0.67 to 1.00.",
